<HelloFraandsPage title="Privacy policy" summary="Aapki jaankari ka istemal kaise hota hai, yahan jaanein." review={true} related={[{"href":"/recording-policy","label":"Recording & consent"},{"href":"/terms","label":"Terms of use"},{"href":"/grievance","label":"Grievance redressal"},{"href":"/intermediary-policy","label":"Intermediary & content policy"}]}>
<h2>Who handles your data</h2>
<p>{'{{COMPANY_NAME}}'} operates Hello Fraands. Contact {'{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}'} for privacy questions, or {'{{GRIEVANCE_EMAIL}}'} for a grievance. Our registered address is {'{{REG_ADDRESS}}'}.</p>
<h2>What we collect and why</h2>
<ul><li>Phone number, name, and email to create your account, verify access, and contact you.</li><li>KYC result flags, gender field, verification date, and provider reference for eligibility and safety. We do not store Aadhaar numbers or document images.</li><li>Call metadata and recordings to connect calls, calculate charges, investigate reports, and check safety.</li><li>Wallet and payment transactions to process top-ups, credits, payouts, and required financial records.</li><li>Reports and support messages to resolve concerns and prevent misuse.</li></ul>
<p>We use this data for the stated service, safety, and legal purposes. Recording consent is explained before calls. Where consent is the basis for processing, you can withdraw it by contacting us; this may limit features that need that data.</p>
<h2>Service providers</h2>
<p>We use Clerk for account access, Didit for KYC, Vobiz or the telephony provider for calls, a WhatsApp API provider for messages, and bank or UPI providers for payments. They receive the data needed for their role. Their own privacy terms also apply to data they handle. Lawful requests from authorities are handled through the grievance officer.</p>
<h2>Retention and access</h2>
<p>Call metadata is kept for 180 days. Audio is kept for {'{{AUDIO_RETENTION_DAYS}}'} days. Transaction records are kept for the period required by tax law. Reports or relevant records may be preserved where a legal requirement applies. Account data is kept while needed for the service and is handled under our <a href="/data-deletion">deletion process</a> when you leave.</p>
<p>Only authorised staff can access data for their work. Only Trust &amp; Safety may review call audio, on a report or a random safety sample. No service can promise absolute security.</p>
<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
<p>You may request access to your personal data, correction of inaccurate details, deletion, or grievance review. Email {'{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}'} from your registered address or include your registered phone number. We verify your identity before acting. Rights and any required exceptions are handled under applicable law, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act where in force and applicable.</p>
<h2>Children and changes</h2>
<p>This is an 18+ service. If we learn that an account belongs to a minor, we close it and handle its data under legal requirements. Report concerns through <a href="/report">Report a user</a>. We update this policy when our practices change and communicate material changes through the service.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
